mh", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17116, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01FUvALN3Aa6EtzVfbQ4pA7Y", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate was 0.18). I rolled production back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). The first rollback attempt halted with a partial failure after us-east (orchestrator error), leaving the fleet mixed; I retried the same rollback to v2.3.0, which completed. Post-rollback status: version v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy=true, error_rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure before re-attempting the v2.3.1 release."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 47716, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01FUvALN3Aa6EtzVfbQ4pA7Y", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 47716, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01FUvALN3Aa6EtzVfbQ4pA7Y", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 48796, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Kk82jUafMUu2SRZnr1TVce", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49096, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Kk82jUafMUu2SRZnr1TVce", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49096, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Kk82jUafMUu2SRZnr1TVce", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 51461, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions and is healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 was unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. Since v2.3.0 had been healthy in production, no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Rollout:** The first attempt halted with an orchestrator partial failure after us-east, leaving the fleet mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback to v2.3.0, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Current status:** v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west and eu-west, healthy=true, error rate 0.002 (down from 0.18).\n- **Incident:** The first incident call timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found INC-0001 already created with the full summary, so I did not open a duplicate. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and the retry.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find out why v2.3.1 failed health checks, and why the orchestrator halted the rollout partway through. Don't re-release v2.3.1 until both are understood.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01YRi2e31WS6Kne3CuVS4zxE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01TJHmii988rjMtSqNVeBocC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent pro